# Build 182. The walking line with Rolf at 0 HP: RenderCharSprites
# (ps2.asm:26657) calls loc_11868 once per slot -- the leader's, then the
# three followers' -- and loc_11868 takes the next id of party_member_id,
# passing over any whose character_data_buffer+2 (HP) is 0, so the living
# close up behind the dead and the slot left over is hidden (2(a0) = 2).
# Nei leads, Rudo and Amy follow, and there is no fourth sprite. Build 181
# drew every member in his own slot, Rolf at the head.
#
# The save is paseo_rolf_dead's: slot 1 on Paseo under Rolf's door, the
# party Rolf, Nei, Rudo, Amy.

start slot 1 routes/saves/paseo_rolf_dead.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 4 45 18
expect party Rolf Nei Rudo Amy
expect hp 0 0
shot 01_door                 # the four stacked under the door, the leader
                             # in front
expect pixel 165 108 $E0A    # Nei's hair, line 1: she leads
press down
wait idle
press left
wait idle
press left
wait idle
press left
wait idle
press left
wait idle
shot 02_line                 # spread out, 16 pixels apart, going left
expect pixel 102 124 $E0A    # the leader's slot: Nei
expect pixel 118 123 $2EE    # the first follower's: Rudo's hair
expect pixel 133 124 $00E    # the second's: Amy's hair
expect pixel 149 124 $640    # the third's: nobody, the ground
